{"id": "sde-d01", "bucket": "single_domain_explicit", "prompt": "手机还剩百分之多少电？还能撑几个小时？", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "DEVICE", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["phone.battery.level"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["phone.battery.remain_time"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "口语；电量、剩余可用时长两项均点名，纯信息无操作", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "sde-d02", "bucket": "single_domain_explicit", "prompt": "耳机连上了没有，电量还剩多少？", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "DEVICE", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["headphones.connection.status"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["headphones.battery.level"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "耳机连接状态+耳机电量；中文承前省略主语，语境将电量限定为耳机——人审确认不接受 phone.battery.level 兜底", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "sde-d03", "bucket": "single_domain_explicit", "prompt": "现在网络是什么状态？再把蓝牙开一下。", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "DEVICE", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["network.status"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["bluetooth.power"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}], "max_actions": 1}, "notes": "信息+一个明确操作（开蓝牙），max_actions=1", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "sde-d04", "bucket": "single_domain_explicit", "prompt": "我在充电呢怎么感觉没反应，帮我看看手机到底是不是在充电状态，电量涨到百分之多少了。", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "DEVICE", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["phone.battery.charging"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["phone.battery.level"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "长句(38字)；排障式表达但两个字段都点名了，只查不操作", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "sde-d05", "bucket": "single_domain_explicit", "prompt": "今天多少度啊？空气质量好不好？", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "WEATHER", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["weather.temperature"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["weather.air_quality"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "口语；气温+空气质量两项点名", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "sde-d06", "bucket": "single_domain_explicit", "prompt": "等会儿要出门，用不用带伞？外面湿度大不大？", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "WEATHER", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["weather.precipitation.probability"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["weather.humidity"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "间接表达1：带伞→降水概率（注册表描述明确此映射）；湿度直接点名", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "sde-d07", "bucket": "single_domain_explicit", "prompt": "未来三天的天气预报念一下，今天到底是晴是阴也说说。", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "WEATHER", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["weather.forecast.daily"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["weather.condition"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "多日预报+今日天气现象，两项均在原话中出现；今日现象单独点名故 condition 不设 optional", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "sde-d08", "bucket": "single_domain_explicit", "prompt": "外面天汽咋样啊，出门冷不冷？", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "WEATHER", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["weather.condition"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["weather.temperature"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "含错别字1（天汽=天气，考语音转写容错）；冷不冷→温度为口语直指，人审确认该映射", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "sde-d09", "bucket": "single_domain_explicit", "prompt": "把空调打开，温度现在设的是多少也说一声。", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "SMART_HOME", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["ac.power"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["ac.temperature"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 1}, "notes": "开空调是操作，温度只查不调——考模型不把温度也当成操作", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "sde-d10", "bucket": "single_domain_explicit", "prompt": "窗帘现在拉到什么位置了？客厅的灯是开着还是关着？", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "SMART_HOME", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["curtain.position"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["light.power"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "两个可操作键但用户只查状态，max_actions=0，专考动作幻觉", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "sde-d11", "bucket": "single_domain_explicit", "prompt": "晚上想在客厅看电影，帮我把窗帘全拉上，再看一下灯的亮度现在是百分之多少。", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "SMART_HOME", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["curtain.position"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["light.brightness"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 1}, "notes": "长句(33字)；拉窗帘是唯一操作，灯亮度只查询", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "sde-d12", "bucket": "single_domain_explicit", "prompt": "下一个会议是几点来着？我今天的待办还有哪些没做完，一起给我念一下吧。", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "TASK", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["calendar.next_event"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["task.list"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "长句(31字)；下一日程+待办列表均点名，纯信息", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "sde-d13", "bucket": "single_domain_explicit", "prompt": "给我定个二十分钟的倒计时，再看看我今天的步数目标完成多少了。", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "TASK", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["timer.duration"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["goal.progress"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 1}, "notes": "定倒计时是操作；步数目标进度→goal.progress（注册表描述含步数）", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "sde-d14", "bucket": "single_domain_explicit", "prompt": "下午三点要吃药，到点叫我一声，另外把今天的代办事项报一遍。", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "TASK", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["reminder.create"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["task.list"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 1}, "notes": "间接表达2：到点叫我一声→创建提醒（绝对时刻，故不接受 timer.duration）；含错别字2（代办=待办）", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "sde-d15", "bucket": "single_domain_explicit", "prompt": "来一句鼓励我的话，再配一条适合发朋友圈的文案。", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "CONTENT", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["content.encouragement"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["content.copy"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "文案域全部为信息键，生成文本不算动作，max_actions=0", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "sde-d16", "bucket": "single_domain_explicit", "prompt": "帮我写一句发给爸妈的中秋祝福，再把刚才那篇文章概括成一段摘要。", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "CONTENT", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["content.greeting"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["content.summary"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "祝福语+摘要两项点名；全组唯一以帮我开头。注意：'刚才那篇文章'指涉会话上下文，若评测 harness 为单轮无上下文，人审需确认这不影响 summary 语素判定", "status": "needsReview"}
