{"id": "neg-d01", "bucket": "negation_correction", "prompt": "明天出门要穿羽绒服不,你别给我报空气质量,用不上", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "WEATHER", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["weather.temperature", "weather.forecast.daily"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["weather.condition"], "role": "SECONDARY", "optional": true}], "forbidden_keys": ["weather.air_quality"], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "直接否定+间接表达:穿羽绒服→温度(明日温度或多日预报任一算对),否定空气质量", "status": "needsReview"}
