{"id": "neg-d05", "bucket": "negation_correction", "prompt": "把客厅的灯打开,亮度可别给我瞎调", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "SMART_HOME", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["light.power"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}], "forbidden_keys": ["light.brightness"], "max_actions": 1}, "notes": "带动作的直接否定:只开灯不动亮度,亮度键出现即错;唯一动作是开灯", "status": "needsReview"}
