{"id": "neg-d07", "bucket": "negation_correction", "prompt": "就看今天啥天气,后面几天的预报别往上堆", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "WEATHER", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["weather.condition"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["weather.temperature"], "role": "SECONDARY", "optional": true}], "forbidden_keys": ["weather.forecast.daily"], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "直接否定,口语'别往上堆';否定多日预报,只保留当天", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "neg-d08", "bucket": "negation_correction", "prompt": "麻烦把卧室空调打开调到二十六度,窗帘你千万别动,我媳妇还在睡觉呢", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "SMART_HOME", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["ac.temperature"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["ac.power"], "role": "SECONDARY_ACTION", "optional": true}], "forbidden_keys": ["curtain.position"], "max_actions": 2}, "notes": "长句(30字)带场景;预防性否定窗帘联动,窗帘键出现即错;开机动作可省,设温必给", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "neg-d09", "bucket": "negation_correction", "prompt": "先看看今天空气质量……算了算了,还是告诉我出门用不用带伞吧,带会就要走了", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "WEATHER", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["weather.precipitation.probability"], "role": "PRIMARY"}], "forbidden_keys": ["weather.air_quality"], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "改口纠正,以最终意图为准;间接表达'带伞'→降水概率;长句+刻意错别字'带会'(待会)", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "neg-d10", "bucket": "negation_correction", "prompt": "给我定个十分钟的计时……哦不对,改成提醒我晚上八点吃药", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "TASK", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["reminder.create"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}], "forbidden_keys": ["timer.duration"], "max_actions": 1}, "notes": "改口纠正:计时改提醒,被撤回的计时键出现即错;最终只剩一个动作", "status": "needsReview"}
