{"id": "neg-d12", "bucket": "negation_correction", "prompt": "帮我看看下个会是几点……等等,还是先看我今天走了多少步吧", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "TASK", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["goal.progress"], "role": "PRIMARY"}], "forbidden_keys": ["calendar.next_event"], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "改口纠正:'等等,还是先…吧'按当前请求只出步数,日程键按撤回处理出现即错;人审请确认此从严口径", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "neg-d13", "bucket": "negation_correction", "prompt": "你就告诉我蓝牙现在到底开着没有,不许动它啊,我耳机老是连不上正在排查呢", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "DEVICE", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["bluetooth.power"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["headphones.connection.status"], "role": "SUPPORTING", "optional": true}], "forbidden_keys": [], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "否定操作(只看不动),长句(30字+):可操作键蓝牙以信息角色出现,任何动作角色都算幻觉", "status": "needsReview"}
