{"id": "crx-d01", "bucket": "cross_domain", "prompt": "明天要出门办事，帮我把明天的天气预报和我的待办事项放在同一张卡片上", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": null, "morphemes": [{"keys": ["weather.forecast.daily", "weather.condition", "weather.temperature"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["task.list"], "role": "PRIMARY"}], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "天气×任务基础组合，长句；\"A和B放同一张卡\"是并列请求，待办由SECONDARY改为PRIMARY，无操作", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "crx-d02", "bucket": "cross_domain", "prompt": "睡觉前看一眼手机还剩多少电、大概还能用多久，顺便帮我把卧室的灯关掉", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": null, "morphemes": [{"keys": ["phone.battery.level"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["phone.battery.remain_time"], "role": "SECONDARY"}, {"keys": ["light.power"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}], "max_actions": 1}, "notes": "设备×智能家居，含一个关灯操作；剩余时长在原话里有明确依据", "status": "needsReview"}
