{"id": "crx-d04", "bucket": "cross_domain", "prompt": "下午有个会，看看我下一个日程是啥，另外手机电量还撑得住不", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": null, "morphemes": [{"keys": ["calendar.next_event"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["phone.battery.level", "phone.battery.remain_time"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "任务×设备，口语；电量或剩余时长任一命中即可", "status": "needsReview"}
