{"id": "crx-d06", "bucket": "cross_domain", "prompt": "给我来一句早安问候吧，顺带配上今天的天气和气温", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": null, "morphemes": [{"keys": ["content.greeting"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["weather.condition"], "role": "SECONDARY"}, {"keys": ["weather.temperature"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "内容×天气；问候语为主体，天气现象和气温原话都点名了", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "crx-d08", "bucket": "cross_domain", "prompt": "蓝牙帮我打开，在看看客厅的灯是不是还亮着", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": null, "morphemes": [{"keys": ["bluetooth.power"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["light.power"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 1}, "notes": "设备×智能家居，含错别字（在→再）；蓝牙是操作、灯只是状态查询，动作上限1", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "crx-d09", "bucket": "cross_domain", "prompt": "跑步目标完成得咋样了？耳机还剩多少电？", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": null, "morphemes": [{"keys": ["goal.progress"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["headphones.battery.level"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "任务×设备，口语短问；运动场景下目标进度+耳机电量", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "crx-d10", "bucket": "cross_domain", "prompt": "今晚出去跑步合适不，顺便看下我这周步数达标没", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": null, "morphemes": [{"keys": ["weather.condition", "weather.temperature", "weather.air_quality"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["goal.progress"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "间接表达：跑步合适吗→天气现象/气温/空气质量任一；\"顺便看下步数\"是明确请求，可保留为必选", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "crx-d11", "bucket": "cross_domain", "prompt": "今天事情实在太多心里有点烦，把我还没做完的待办列出来，再给我来一句加油打气的话", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": null, "morphemes": [{"keys": ["task.list"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["content.encouragement"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "内容×任务，长句带情绪；鼓励语有明确原话依据；列出待办是展示不是动作", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "crx-d12", "bucket": "cross_domain", "prompt": "明天要是下雨就提前提醒我收衣服，把降水概率也放卡上让我看看", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": null, "morphemes": [{"keys": ["reminder.create"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["weather.precipitation.probability", "weather.forecast.daily"], "role": "PRIMARY"}], "max_actions": 1}, "notes": "天气×任务，含创建提醒这一个操作；问的是明天，降水概率或含明日的预报列表都可接受", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "crx-d13", "bucket": "cross_domain", "prompt": "查一下今天空气质量咋样，另外我现在连的是无线网还是流量", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": null, "morphemes": [{"keys": ["weather.air_quality"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["network.status"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "天气×设备；无线网还是流量→网络状态，不是Wi-Fi开关操作", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "crx-d14", "bucket": "cross_domain", "prompt": "安排太乱了，帮我把明天的事用一段话总结一下，第一个日程是啥也标出来", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": null, "morphemes": [{"keys": ["content.summary"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["calendar.next_event"], "role": "SECONDARY"}, {"keys": ["task.list"], "role": "SUPPORTING", "optional": true}], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "内容×任务的摘要方向，与d11不重复；注册表只有next_event一个日程键，\"第一个日程\"按此判；待办清单给了不扣分", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "crx-d15", "bucket": "cross_domain", "prompt": "外面事不是在下雨啊，家里空调是不是还开着呢", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": null, "morphemes": [{"keys": ["weather.condition"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["ac.power"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "智能家居×天气，含错别字（事→是）；问的是当前是否在下雨，只认weather.condition，删去降水概率备选（概率答不了\"现在\"）；禁止出现开关动作", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "crx-d16", "bucket": "cross_domain", "prompt": "到家啦，客厅的灯和空调现在都是啥状态，无线网连上了没", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": null, "morphemes": [{"keys": ["light.power"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["ac.power"], "role": "PRIMARY"}, {"keys": ["network.status"], "role": "SECONDARY"}], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "智能家居×设备到家场景，三项全是状态查询；\"连上了没\"问的是连接状态，删去wifi.power备选（开关开着不等于已连上），动作数必须为0", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "mac-d01", "bucket": "multi_action", "prompt": "把客厅的灯关掉，空调调到26度", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "SMART_HOME", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["light.power"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["ac.temperature"], "role": "SECONDARY_ACTION"}], "max_actions": 2}, "notes": "两动作：关灯+调温；只说了调温度，不该额外幻觉出开关空调的动作。", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "mac-d02", "bucket": "multi_action", "prompt": "开个空调呗，窗帘也拉上，顺便说说外面现在多少度", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "SMART_HOME", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["ac.power"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["curtain.position"], "role": "SECONDARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["weather.temperature"], "role": "SUPPORTING"}], "max_actions": 2}, "notes": "口语；'外面多少度'是附带查天气温度的信息语素，不算动作，max_actions 仍为 2；动作都在家居域故 domain 定 SMART_HOME（与 d07/d14 口径一致）。", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "mac-d03", "bucket": "multi_action", "prompt": "蓝牙打开，屏幕调暗一点，电池还能撑多久也说一声", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "DEVICE", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["bluetooth.power"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["display.brightness"], "role": "SECONDARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["phone.battery.remain_time"], "role": "SUPPORTING"}], "max_actions": 2}, "notes": "'还能撑多久'对应剩余可用时长（信息），不是电量百分比，也不算第三个动作。", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "mac-d04", "bucket": "multi_action", "prompt": "无线网大开一下，蓝牙不用了就关掉吧", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "DEVICE", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["wifi.power"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["bluetooth.power"], "role": "SECONDARY_ACTION"}], "max_actions": 2}, "notes": "含错别字：'大开'应为'打开'，考鲁棒性；一开一关两个开关动作。", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "mac-d05", "bucket": "multi_action", "prompt": "定个二十分钟倒计时，提醒我晚上八点交周报，还剩啥待办也念念", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "TASK", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["timer.duration"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["reminder.create"], "role": "SECONDARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["task.list"], "role": "SUPPORTING"}], "max_actions": 2}, "notes": "倒计时和提醒是两个不同动作不能合并；念待办是附带信息展示。", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "mac-d06", "bucket": "multi_action", "prompt": "外面太晒了，帮忙遮一遮，屋里再弄得凉快点", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "SMART_HOME", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["curtain.position"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["ac.power", "ac.temperature"], "role": "SECONDARY_ACTION"}], "max_actions": 2}, "notes": "间接表达：'遮一遮'=拉窗帘，'凉快点'=开空调或调低温度（命中任一算对）；同时给开机+调温两个动作会超 max_actions=2，考取舍。", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "mac-d07", "bucket": "multi_action", "prompt": "睡觉前把卧室灯关了，窗帘合上，明早下不下雨也顺嘴报一下", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "SMART_HOME", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["light.power"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["curtain.position"], "role": "SECONDARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["weather.precipitation.probability", "weather.condition", "weather.forecast.daily"], "role": "SUPPORTING"}], "max_actions": 2}, "notes": "'下不下雨'首选降水概率，天气现象/明日预报也可接受；查天气不占动作名额。", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "mac-d08", "bucket": "multi_action", "prompt": "提醒我下午三点开会，蓝牙先关了省电，电量还剩多少说一下", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": null, "morphemes": [{"keys": ["reminder.create"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["bluetooth.power"], "role": "SECONDARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["phone.battery.level"], "role": "SUPPORTING"}], "max_actions": 2}, "notes": "动作跨域（任务+设备）domain 留 null 待人审定；电量是附带信息。", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "mac-d09", "bucket": "multi_action", "prompt": "大晚上的屏幕晃得眼睛疼，弄暗一点，无线网用不着也先关了", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "DEVICE", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["display.brightness"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["wifi.power"], "role": "SECONDARY_ACTION"}], "max_actions": 2}, "notes": "间接表达：'晃眼睛疼弄暗点'=调低亮度，没提电量等其他内容不该多给。", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "mac-d10", "bucket": "multi_action", "prompt": "灯调亮一点，空调降到23度，窗帘帮我拉开一半", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "SMART_HOME", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["light.brightness"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["ac.temperature"], "role": "SECONDARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["curtain.position"], "role": "SECONDARY_ACTION"}], "max_actions": 3}, "notes": "三动作全是带数值/程度的调节：亮度不是灯开关，'降到23度'也不该附加空调开关。", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "mac-d11", "bucket": "multi_action", "prompt": "马上要开视频会了，帮我把无线网打开，屏幕调亮一些，蓝牙也开一下好连耳机，再看看耳机还剩多少电", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "DEVICE", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["wifi.power"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["display.brightness"], "role": "SECONDARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["bluetooth.power"], "role": "SECONDARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["headphones.battery.level"], "role": "SUPPORTING"}], "max_actions": 3}, "notes": "长句；三个设备动作+耳机电量附带信息，注意别把'连耳机'幻觉成第四个动作（耳机连接状态是信息键、无操作键）。", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "mac-d12", "bucket": "multi_action", "prompt": "煮着面呢，定个三分钟计时，客厅灯开一下，十点提醒我给我妈回电话", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": null, "morphemes": [{"keys": ["timer.duration"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["light.power"], "role": "SECONDARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["reminder.create"], "role": "SECONDARY_ACTION"}], "max_actions": 3}, "notes": "口语场景；跨域（任务+家居）domain 留 null；计时和提醒是两个独立动作。", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "mac-d13", "bucket": "multi_action", "prompt": "帮我订个四十分钟的午睡到计时，窗帘拉上，卧室灯也关咯", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": null, "morphemes": [{"keys": ["timer.duration"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["curtain.position"], "role": "SECONDARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["light.power"], "role": "SECONDARY_ACTION"}], "max_actions": 3}, "notes": "含错别字（同音输入错）：'订个''到计时'应为'定个''倒计时'；午睡场景三动作，跨域 domain 留 null。", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "mac-d14", "bucket": "multi_action", "prompt": "出门前记得把空调关了，灯也全关掉，窗帘给我拉严实点，对了今天空气质量咋样", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": "SMART_HOME", "morphemes": [{"keys": ["ac.power"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["light.power"], "role": "SECONDARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["curtain.position"], "role": "SECONDARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["weather.air_quality"], "role": "SUPPORTING"}], "max_actions": 3}, "notes": "长句口语；出门场景三个关闭类动作+空气质量附带信息，信息不占动作名额。", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "mac-d16", "bucket": "multi_action", "prompt": "要睡了，提醒我明早六点半起来赶高铁，把灯关了，空调调到28度，今天步数达标了没也说一声", "expected": {"reject": false, "domain": null, "morphemes": [{"keys": ["reminder.create"], "role": "PRIMARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["light.power"], "role": "SECONDARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["ac.temperature"], "role": "SECONDARY_ACTION"}, {"keys": ["goal.progress"], "role": "SUPPORTING"}], "max_actions": 3}, "notes": "长句；睡前场景三动作（'调到28度'只落温度键，不附加空调开关）+步数（goal.progress）附带信息；跨域 domain 留 null 待人审定。", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "oof-d01", "bucket": "out_of_field", "prompt": "手机烫得跟暖手宝似的，现在电池温度到多少度了？", "expected": {"reject": true, "domain": "DEVICE", "morphemes": [], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "电池温度不存在，最易假绑到 phone.battery.level，也可能被假绑到 weather.temperature（词面同为'温度'）", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "oof-d02", "bucket": "out_of_field", "prompt": "查一下这手机电池健康读还剩百分之多少，是不是该换电池了", "expected": {"reject": true, "domain": "DEVICE", "morphemes": [], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "电池健康度不存在（含错别字'读'），百分比形态最易假绑到 phone.battery.level 或 phone.battery.remain_time", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "oof-d03", "bucket": "out_of_field", "prompt": "现在网速多少兆啊，下载怎么这么慢", "expected": {"reject": true, "domain": "DEVICE", "morphemes": [], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "网速/下载速度不存在，最易假绑到 network.status（网络状态是枚举，不是速率）；与 d04 考点相邻但概念（速率 vs 信号格数）和句式均不同，保留", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "oof-d04", "bucket": "out_of_field", "prompt": "我在地下车库总感觉打电话断断续续的，你给我看看现在手机信号强度是满格还是只有一两格", "expected": {"reject": true, "domain": "DEVICE", "morphemes": [], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "信号强度不存在（长句样本），最易假绑到 network.status", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "oof-d05", "bucket": "out_of_field", "prompt": "耳机的降噪模式现在开的是通透还是降噪？", "expected": {"reject": true, "domain": "DEVICE", "morphemes": [], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "耳机降噪模式不存在，最易假绑到 headphones.connection.status（同为耳机相关的枚举）或 headphones.battery.level", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "oof-d06", "bucket": "out_of_field", "prompt": "今天风大不大？几级风啊，我想去放风筝", "expected": {"reject": true, "domain": "WEATHER", "morphemes": [], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "风力/风向不存在，最易假绑到 weather.condition（把'风'当成天气现象枚举值）", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "oof-d07", "bucket": "out_of_field", "prompt": "中午出门要不要涂防晒霜啊？", "expected": {"reject": true, "domain": "WEATHER", "morphemes": [], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "紫外线指数不存在（间接场景问法）。注册表把'要不要带伞'显式映射到 precipitation.probability，而防晒无对应键，构成刻意对照；最易假绑到 weather.condition", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "oof-d08", "bucket": "out_of_field", "prompt": "想去江边拍晚霞，今天几点天黑？", "expected": {"reject": true, "domain": "WEATHER", "morphemes": [], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "日出日落时间不存在（间接场景问法），最易假绑到 weather.forecast.daily 或 weather.condition", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "oof-d09", "bucket": "out_of_field", "prompt": "最近一到春天鼻炎就犯，你帮我查查今天外面花粉浓度高不高，高的话我就不去公园了", "expected": {"reject": true, "domain": "WEATHER", "morphemes": [], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "花粉浓度不存在（长句样本）；weather.air_quality 是标准空气质量枚举、不含花粉浓度，正是要考的近邻假绑", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "oof-d10", "bucket": "out_of_field", "prompt": "客厅的灯能不能调成暖黄光？现在这个白光太刺眼了", "expected": {"reject": true, "domain": "SMART_HOME", "morphemes": [], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "灯光色温/颜色不存在，最易假绑到 light.brightness（'刺眼'诱导成调暗亮度的动作幻觉），max_actions=0 考动作抑制", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "oof-d11", "bucket": "out_of_field", "prompt": "空调开一晚上得耗多少度店啊？", "expected": {"reject": true, "domain": "SMART_HOME", "morphemes": [], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "空调耗电量不存在（含错别字'店'=电），最易假绑到 ac.temperature（同为空调数值）或 ac.power", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "oof-d12", "bucket": "out_of_field", "prompt": "卧室加湿器帮我开到百分之六十的湿度", "expected": {"reject": true, "domain": "SMART_HOME", "morphemes": [], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "加湿器设备不在注册表，'湿度百分之六十'最易跨域假绑到 weather.humidity，百分比形态也可能假绑 curtain.position；虽是操作句式但因 reject 故 max_actions=0", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "oof-d13", "bucket": "out_of_field", "prompt": "下午那个会都有谁参加，把参会人名单给我看看", "expected": {"reject": true, "domain": "TASK", "morphemes": [], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "日程的参会人列表不存在，最易假绑到 calendar.next_event（同一个会议实体），LIST 形态也可能诱导假绑 task.list", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "oof-d14", "bucket": "out_of_field", "prompt": "我今天走了这么久，帮我算算大概消耗了多少卡路里，够不够抵消中午那顿火锅", "expected": {"reject": true, "domain": "TASK", "morphemes": [], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "卡路里消耗不存在（长句样本），最易假绑到 goal.progress（注册表里步数与它词面最近）", "status": "needsReview"}
{"id": "oof-d16", "bucket": "out_of_field", "prompt": "上礼拜你给我写的那条朋友圈文案还能找出来吗？", "expected": {"reject": true, "domain": "CONTENT", "morphemes": [], "max_actions": 0}, "notes": "历史文案检索不存在；主体明确是'文案'故 CONTENT 域归属成立，考点是模型不得用 content.copy 重新生成来冒充'找回'", "status": "needsReview"}
